            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Justin Meaden"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Really enjoyable workshop despite not getting the weather we were hoping for with guidance and advice throughout when requested and enabled me to make the most of a lovely location despite the weather not being perfect.",
